Additional terms (GPL-3.0 section 7(b)): keep the attribution "OGBox by Press5elect"; see NOTICE.

hakuX (github.com/rfandango/hakuX) at a7cdb5a975e31730d488c47f6f10440b16c1e6f4 (ps5/tools/fetch-hakux.sh)
with this patch is the hakuX that OGBox builds: ps5/tools/prepare-hakux.sh lays it over
vendor/hakuX's copy. It covers native/, hw/, tests/ and the licence files: the native CPU backend
(native/cpu/cpu_native.c, codepatch.c), savestates, trainers, CHD images, the PS5's host
adaptations, and hakuX-lr's (github.com/portare-ch/hakuX-lr, PortareOS and its contributors,
GPL-3.0-or-later) graphics, audio, disc and kernel work, merged. Made from these commits of the
native core's work tree (oldest first; author: subject):

