+ * hakuX-lr's native/cpu/kvm_rsqrt.c (its #219), its decoder taking a gs:
+ * base too (the native CPU's GS is the KPCR, as fs: is) and its index built
+ * from any estimator (the host tests give it one that isn't this host's).
+ */
