+/* -------------------------------------------------- interlocked lists
+ *
+ * From hakuX-lr 1f74e59cde (portare-ch, GPL-2.0-or-later). The guest CPU
+ * stands still while a kernel call runs, so these are plain reads and writes
+ * of guest memory, and their spin locks are never taken. LIST_ENTRY: Flink
